{"item_uid": "分科111-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "黃荊全株可入藥，果實在中藥名為「牡荊子」，煎服可治感冒，是原住民族與漢人常用的保健植物資源。原住民在山林中採集此植物時，發揮其傳統生態知識，較植物專家效率高，主要是其具有下列何種傳統生態知識？", "options": {"A": "熟悉黃荊的生物分類", "B": "熟悉黃荊的外觀特徵", "C": "熟悉黃荊的藥用療效", "D": "熟悉黃荊的在地棲地"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 64.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 76.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 76.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 70.0, 66.0, 61.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科111-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "清代方志對臺灣某地常見的聚落和屋舍建材形容如下：「其屋宇俱結於山凹之內、水隈之處，…。牆壁俱用老古石所砌，其石乃海中鹹氣所結，取去之時石猶鬆脆；迨風雨漂淋，去盡鹹氣，即成堅實。價廉而取便。…之房屋，悉皆用此。其屋亦高不過一丈一、二尺之外者；非為省工價，為因海風猛烈，不敢高大，以防飄刮故耳。」該地最可能位於何處？", "options": {"A": "宜蘭蘇澳", "B": "新北金山", "C": "臺南北門", "D": "澎湖西嶼"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 9.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 86.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 95.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 74.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 74.0, "discrimination": 21.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 89.0, 83.0, 69.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科111-geography-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "全球氣候變遷對人類食物來源產生巨大的影響，例如日本北海道海域的主要漁獲是鮭魚等冷水魚類，但近年因氣候變遷導致漁獲量大減，而原本棲息在日本本州海域的黑鮪魚卻大量出現於北海道海域，造成此現象最可能的原因為何？", "options": {"A": "海水暖化", "B": "海平面上升", "C": "海岸暴潮頻率增加", "D": "海水中二氧化碳濃度增加"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 96.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 100.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 89.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 96.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 89.0, "discrimination": 11.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 100.0, 99.0, 97.0, 83.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科111-geography-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "圖1為某國的人口出生數變化圖，雖然整體趨勢呈現下降，但受到該國傳統文化觀念影響，逢特定年分人口出生數呈現反轉增加的現象，由此現象推斷該國最可能位於哪個文化圈？", "options": {"A": "西方文化圈", "B": "東亞文化圈", "C": "伊斯蘭文化圈", "D": "南亞、東南亞文化圈"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 53.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 77.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 53.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 91.0, 81.0, 67.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科111-geography-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 111, "year_ce": 2022, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "在冬季至春季之間，中國西北與蒙古一帶，時常有大量細顆粒的揚塵被帶至高空，受西風氣流向東傳，引發東亞等國的空氣汙染，稱之為沙塵暴。若某生想要研究生成沙塵暴來源地的環境特徵，最適合使用下列哪些圖資？", "options": {"A": "甲丙", "B": "甲丁", "C": "乙丙", "D": "乙丁"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 46.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 63.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 30.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 63.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [66.0, 55.0, 45.0, 37.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
